    <meta name="abstract" content="Spotex is Foreign Exchange (FX) Electronic Communication Network (ECN) in US available to institutions for foreign exchange trades. Spotex provides proprietary matching engine coupled with a highly sophisticated low-latency transport mechanism and end to end trading solutions.">
